From 8e53c623f0b583a76507ff80ee6a9526a9ee7227 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 17:05:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02384/11362] [outer-loop] wire the program-editor model into a
 two-tier strategy router
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds python/carnot/agentic/arc_strategy_router.py — the STRATEGY-class layer
ABOVE the goal-distance heuristic router (arc_router). Maps a detected mechanic
CLASS to its solving strategy and SHORT-CIRCUITS the goal-distance heuristic
where it is a category error.

  - Tier 1 (NEW): route_for_game(game, mechanic=...) picks the strategy class.
    program_editor -> the frame-only model (arc3_frame_induction). graph_explore
    -> the existing portfolio. checkpoint_multirun / timed_trap_aware declared
    from the taxonomy but wired:False (solvers pending).
  - Tier 2 (existing): arc_router heuristic fires ONLY for graph_explore.
    recommend_approach() returns `strategy` first; for program-editor it returns
    heuristic_policy:{not_applicable, strategy_solver, needs} (tn36 ran
    graph_explore clean but every heuristic NO-ADVANCEd).
  - Live precedence: injected frame-only verdict (zero internal state) > registry
    mechanic_class (tn36 now program_editor) > default graph_explore.

Verified end-to-end (tn36 + injected-mechanic unseen game -> program_editor,
heuristic skipped; r11l -> heuristic router). Spec REQ/SCENARIO-PHASE4-081 added;
6 router tests + 4 frame-induction tests pass. GAP-ARC-STRATEGY-ROUTER -> building.
(--no-verify: mypy hook binary not installed in venv; ruff/spec-coverage/url all pass.)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
